&lt;p&gt;We are a passionate team of highly skilled engineers and top-tier designers based in Hong Kong. We develop diverse games for the &lt;strong&gt;Nex Playground&lt;/strong&gt;, covering genres like arcade, action, rhythm, puzzle, and educational. Our hit titles include &lt;em&gt;Starri&lt;/em&gt;, &lt;em&gt;Bluey&lt;/em&gt;, &lt;em&gt;Mirrorama&lt;/em&gt;, &lt;em&gt;Cookie Monster&lt;/em&gt;, and &lt;em&gt;Tumbobots, Doodle Heads, Elmo Says,&lt;/em&gt; etc.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a place to collaborate with passionate developers, unleash your creativity, and deepen your engineering skills. You will participate in 1-3 game projects every year, as a game engineer who works on both engineering and product design.&lt;/p&gt;
