&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Software Engineering: &lt;/strong&gt;Build game architecture, UI/UX, gameplay logic, motion control algorithms, and internal tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product Design:&lt;/strong&gt; Participate in game design, rapid prototyping, and iterate based on playtesting feedback.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tech Research:&lt;/strong&gt; Explore new technologies and share knowledge with the team to drive collective growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; (For Senior level) Lead project development, collaborate across disciplines, make key technical decisions, and track progress.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Growth Mindset: &lt;/strong&gt;Humble and eager to learn. Active in side projects (open-source softwares, indie games etc.) is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Innovation: &lt;/strong&gt;Creative and loves exploring fresh ideas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Audience Focus:&lt;/strong&gt; Interested in creating family-friendly games for kids, parents, and seniors. (Being a parent is a plus!)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Passion for Quality:&lt;/strong&gt; You care deeply about details and aim for world-class quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Engineering Best Practices: &lt;/strong&gt;You write clean, maintainable, and robust code.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tech-Savvy:&lt;/strong&gt; Broad interest in technology (App dev, Web, Databases, UI/UX, Animation).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Optimization:&lt;/strong&gt; Skilled in optimizing memory, GPU, CPU and shader usage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Unity Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Familiarity with Unity. Experience shipping high-quality games is a bonus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Troubleshooting:&lt;/strong&gt; Able to fix compilation and runtime errors effectively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Prototyping:&lt;/strong&gt; Able to build rapid prototypes in Unity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tool Creation: &lt;/strong&gt;Experience building Unity tools (e.g., level editors, data visualizers).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication:&lt;/strong&gt; Clear expression of technical details. Experience teaching or mentoring others is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leadership: &lt;/strong&gt;(For Senior level) Proven ability to lead a team to deliver high-quality results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
