&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;This role partners closely with our Information Security team on security-related operations. If&amp;nbsp;you bring broader experience in IT strategy, procurement, or infrastructure, we’d love to hear&amp;nbsp;about it — there’s room to grow the scope of this role over time.&lt;/p&gt;
