&lt;li&gt;4+ years of experience in People Operations, HR administration, or a similar people-facing role—ideally in a fast-paced technology or startup environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional organizational skills and attention to detail, with a strong commitment to data integrity and confidentiality&lt;/li&gt;
