&lt;li&gt;Proven experience selecting, contracting, and managing marketing agencies in Japan end-to-end.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of Japan’s digital marketing ecosystem, gaming culture, and consumer behavior across gaming, family, and educational audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong cross-functional collaboration skills; comfortable co-owning brand strategy with a peer, managing up to a General Manager, and managing down to a future team member.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Native or near-native Japanese proficiency&lt;/strong&gt; (written and verbal); strong English for collaboration with US Publishing team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable operating in a fast-paced, startup-like environment with lean resources and shifting priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice-to-Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience marketing subscription services, gaming platforms, or digital content in Japan.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in games marketing, including title launch campaigns and live operations marketing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing or mentoring a performance marketing team member.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with marketing analytics platforms (e.g., Google Analytics, Adjust, AppsFlyer) and performance marketing dashboards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in community management or influencer marketing for gaming or family audiences in Japan.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working across US-Japan time zones and bridging publishing and marketing teams.&lt;/li&gt;
