&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nex is located in&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;San Jose, California, USA&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Hong&amp;nbsp;Kong&lt;/strong&gt;. Learn more about us at&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nex.inc/who-we-are&quot; target=&quot;&quot;&gt;nex.inc/who-we-are&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We encourage applications even if you don’t meet more than 50% of the requirements — we believe that experience comes in many forms!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;274&quot; data-end=&quot;661&quot;&gt;Nex is an equal opportunity employer and does not discriminate on the basis of race, color, religion, sex (including pregnancy, childbirth, gender identity, and sexual orientation), national origin, ancestry, age, physical or mental disability, medical condition, genetic information, marital status, military or veteran status, or any other characteristic protected by applicable law. This policy applies to all individuals at every stage of the employment relationship, including all current and prospective employees, and covers all employment decisions including recruitment, hiring, job assignment, promotion, compensation, benefits, training, discipline and termination.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;667&quot; data-end=&quot;811&quot;&gt;We are committed to providing a workplace free from discrimination and harassment and to fostering an inclusive environment for all employees.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Nex is on a mission to help families rediscover the joy of movement. Created by parents for parents, Nex combines technology and play to deliver fun, social, and interactive experiences powered by natural body motion, encouraging kids and adults to move more, play more, and have fun together. Nex Playground, the company’s award-winning active play system, is purpose-built to get families moving year-round, with safety and privacy as core considerations in its intentional design. It is certified kidSAFE+ COPPA compliant and built to support healthy, active play for all ages and abilities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nex Playground features a growing library of 50+ experiences, including motion and dance games, fitness and educational experiences, and Nex Originals. Content includes collaborations with partners like Hasbro, Sesame Workshop, and NBCUniversal. Nex has been recognized by Fast Company’s Most Innovative Companies, TIME’s Best Inventions, and Parents’ Best Entertainment System for Families, and has earned Red Dot, IDEA, and Core77 international design awards. We encourage you to explore &lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.playthatmovesyou.com/p/have-fun&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.playthatmovesyou.com/p/have-fun&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;Have Fun&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.playthatmovesyou.com/p/is-motion-gaming-back&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.playthatmovesyou.com/p/is-motion-gaming-back&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;Is Motion Gaming Back?&lt;/a&gt;, as they offer a deeper look into our culture, values, and explain how our approach to motion gaming differs from previous generations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To protect yourself from recruitment scams, please note that Nex communicates through official company emails ending in @nex.inc. If you receive a suspicious email or message, please do not respond and report it immediately to us.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;paragraph-3&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location: San Jose, California (Hybrid)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Annual salary: USD 150,000 to USD 180,000&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Type: 6-month Full-Time contract with the possibility of conversion to FTE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;paragraph-3&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;bold-text-2&quot;&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a Senior Manager, Talent Acquisition Operations to be the operational backbone of our Talent Acquisition function. In this role, you will lead and develop the TA Ops team, owning the people management and overall function. You&#39;ll own the systems, data, processes, and programs that enable our TA team to hire with speed, quality, and consistency. You&#39;ll work closely with Director, Talent Acquisition and cross-functional stakeholders to build scalable infrastructure as we grow, bringing both strategic thinking and adding structure to chaos along the way.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Candidates may be considered at the Manager level based on experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;text-block-4&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;bold-text-2&quot;&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data, Reporting &amp;amp; Analytics&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;18vuctp&quot; data-start=&quot;552&quot; data-end=&quot;723&quot;&gt;Own all Talent Acquisition reporting and analytics, including dashboards, recruiter performance metrics, pipeline health, time-to-fill, and quality-of-hire indicators.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;13659vb&quot; data-start=&quot;724&quot; data-end=&quot;826&quot;&gt;Build and maintain systems to monitor hiring progress, recruiter capacity, and demand forecasting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1xbdd5w&quot; data-start=&quot;827&quot; data-end=&quot;929&quot;&gt;Serve as the source of truth for open role tracking, approval workflows, and hiring plan accuracy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1kas13x&quot; data-start=&quot;930&quot; data-end=&quot;1083&quot;&gt;Translate data into actionable insights that drive continuous improvement across the recruiting lifecycle and ensure data integrity across all systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hiring &amp;amp; Candidate Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;8zy2r0&quot; data-start=&quot;277&quot; data-end=&quot;453&quot;&gt;Lead the TA Ops function, including interview coordination, scheduling infrastructure, and execution of end-to-end hiring workflows across teams and timezones.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;129r60i&quot; data-start=&quot;454&quot; data-end=&quot;602&quot;&gt;Own and scale the candidate experience strategy, ensuring a consistent, high-quality experience from application through offer across all roles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;ps6hst&quot; data-start=&quot;603&quot; data-end=&quot;762&quot;&gt;Manage and develop a team responsible for hiring coordination and candidate experience delivery, setting clear goals, processes, and performance standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1pqodsv&quot; data-start=&quot;763&quot; data-end=&quot;950&quot;&gt;Partner with Recruiters and Hiring Managers to improve hiring efficiency, drive adoption of best practices, and continuously optimize speed, quality, and candidate satisfaction metrics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operations Enhancement &amp;amp; Process Excellence&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify inefficiencies in recruiting workflows and lead cross-functional initiatives to streamline and improve them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and document scalable operating procedures, playbooks, and standards for a growing TA organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive a culture of operational rigor and continuous improvement across the TA function.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a hands-on problem solver, stepping in directly where the team needs support or where gaps emerge.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tech Enablement &amp;amp; Recruiting Systems&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and optimize TA systems including Greenhouse ATS, Notion for recruiting workflows/playbooks, scheduling tools, and AI recruiting tools to improve operational efficiency and standardization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evaluate and onboard new tools as the organization scales, with a clear ROI and adoption framework.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evolve the internal TA &quot;help desk&quot; into a self-serve, automated support function to reduce operational overhead.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Employer Branding &amp;amp; Talent Acquisition Initiatives&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;bolx32&quot; data-start=&quot;211&quot; data-end=&quot;383&quot;&gt;Design and execute employer branding initiatives that strengthen the talent narrative and attract high-quality candidates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1v9ecbl&quot; data-start=&quot;384&quot; data-end=&quot;545&quot;&gt;Lead the development and continuous optimization of careers pages and candidate-facing content to improve engagement and conversion across the hiring funnel.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;n2rwd7&quot; data-start=&quot;546&quot; data-end=&quot;725&quot;&gt;Drive TA initiatives that enhance hiring effectiveness and candidate experience, leveraging data to measure impact and continuously improve attraction and conversion outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;bold-text-2&quot;&gt;What You Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years of experience in global Talent Acquisition / recruiting operations preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of experience managing high-performing teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting a hyper growth company building scalable processes in high-growth environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep expertise in recruiting systems and talent operations tooling, including Greenhouse ATS, Notion driven workflows and documentation, and reporting tools such as Excel and BI Tools for dashboards and analytics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong headcount planning, workforce planning, and reporting experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong project management skills with the ability to manage multiple high-impact initiatives simultaneously.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data-driven decision maker with strong analytical capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional cross-functional communication and stakeholder management skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Hybrid&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;bold-text-2&quot;&gt;We Offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-item-16&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;list-item-16&quot;&gt;Competitive compensation package.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;list-item-23&quot;&gt;Flexible working hours and vacation policy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;list-item-23&quot;&gt;Product-driven culture that treasures talents and individual growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;list-item-23&quot;&gt;Front-row seat and hands-on experience with cutting edge technologies in the evolving gaming field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nex is located in&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;San Jose, California, USA&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Hong&amp;nbsp;Kong&lt;/strong&gt;. Learn more about us at&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nex.inc/who-we-are&quot; target=&quot;&quot;&gt;nex.inc/who-we-are&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We encourage applications even if you don’t meet more than 50% of the requirements — we believe that experience comes in many forms!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;274&quot; data-end=&quot;661&quot;&gt;Nex is an equal opportunity employer and does not discriminate on the basis of race, color, religion, sex (including pregnancy, childbirth, gender identity, and sexual orientation), national origin, ancestry, age, physical or mental disability, medical condition, genetic information, marital status, military or veteran status, or any other characteristic protected by applicable law. This policy applies to all individuals at every stage of the employment relationship, including all current and prospective employees, and covers all employment decisions including recruitment, hiring, job assignment, promotion, compensation, benefits, training, discipline and termination.&lt;/p&gt;
