&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a Sr. Financial Analyst to be a key member and strong contributor toward scaling our Corporate FP&amp;amp;A capabilities, and lead business partnership across our G&amp;amp;A functions.&amp;nbsp; This is a high-visibility role working closely with senior management that requires the ability to dive deep while operating strategically to support and enable Nex’s mission and long term goals.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build comprehensive financial models that span investment cases, strategic planning, and cost of capital considerations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design new financial and management reporting that effectively measures our KPIs, business and financial performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage the G&amp;amp;A function’s annual budgeting, recurring forecasts, and long-range planning processes including variance analysis, operational support and ad hoc modeling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and reach alignment with G&amp;amp;A stakeholders on key performance indicators that drive financial ownership, visibility, and operational efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide analytic support and develop actionable insights that will influence resource and capital allocation decisions more effectively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner and support business case development on investment proposals, and facilitate through the approval decision process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in Finance, Accounting, Economics, or related field; MBA or CFA a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4+ years of experience with 2-3 years in investment banking, private equity or corporate finance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong proficiency with financial modeling and investment evaluation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excel / Google Sheets expertise; experience with ERP systems and financial planning tools (e.g., Netsuite, Adaptive, Anaplan, etc.) preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent analytical, communication, and presentation skills—you can turn complex data into actionable insights&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Entrepreneurial mindset and comfortable operating in a fast-moving, ambiguous environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passion for gaming and emerging technologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;bold-text-2&quot;&gt;We Offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
