&lt;h3 class=&quot;paragraph-3&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;bold-text-2&quot;&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a highly meticulous &lt;strong&gt;UI Technical Artist&lt;/strong&gt; who bridges the gap between UI/UX design and Unity implementation, with an uncompromising commitment to visual precision.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you’ll bring user interfaces to life through flawless technical setup, UI motion design, and polished micro-interactions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We need a candidate who truly aims for pixel-perfect fidelity. Someone who cares deeply about aligning margins, font rendering, anchoring, and visual feedback down to the exact pixel, while maintaining a strong animation sense and high visual polish.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;text-block-4&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;bold-text-2&quot;&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pixel-Perfect UI Implementation in Unity:&lt;/strong&gt; Translate 2D design layouts into Unity UI with relentless accuracy, ensuring exact spacing, scale, typography, and responsiveness across varying resolutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;UI Motion &amp;amp; Animation Design:&lt;/strong&gt; Design, animate, and fine-tune UI transitions, dynamic menus, and micro-interactions using Unity Timeline, Animator, Spine 2D, or tweening packages, with a sharp eye for weight, timing, and easing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Visual Feedback:&lt;/strong&gt; Elevate the player experience by crafting crisp visual feedback using lightweight shaders (Shader Graph), UI particle systems, and subtle motion effects that feel satisfying and responsive.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Precision Asset Management &amp;amp; Optimization:&lt;/strong&gt; Set up dynamic anchoring, Sprite Atlases, text rendering (TextMeshPro), and UI prefabs to maintain visual perfection without compromising game performance or draw call limits.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Design &amp;amp; Engineering Alignment:&lt;/strong&gt; Serve as the visual quality gatekeeper by collaborating closely with UI/UX designers to honor their visual vision and working with engineers to tie UI elements into game logic seamlessly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Maintain High UI Standards:&lt;/strong&gt; Establish robust, scalable UI structures, prefabs, and workflow guidelines that ensure consistency and visual rigor across our entire game portfolio.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;text-block-4&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;bold-text-2&quot;&gt;What We&#39;re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Uncompromising Eye for Precision:&lt;/strong&gt; A relentless commitment to pixel perfection, sharp detail, and visual accuracy when translating static or prototype designs into live, in-engine UI.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Solid Unity UI Implementation Skills:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven hands-on experience building, structuring, and optimizing UI Canvas setups in Unity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong Animation &amp;amp; Motion Sense:&lt;/strong&gt; Deep understanding of timing, curve dynamics, and movement principles tailored specifically to menu transitions, UI states, and player feedback.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical UI Asset Knowledge:&lt;/strong&gt; Expertise in preparing UI assets, slice/9-grid setups, Sprite Atlases, TextMeshPro configurations, and clean prefab architecture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;UI FX Capabilities:&lt;/strong&gt; Practical experience creating UI feedback effects using particle systems, shaders (Shader Graph), or vector-based UI techniques.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
