&lt;h3&gt;The Role&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking an exceptionally talented UI/UX Designer with a strong visual impulse and elevated design craft to help shape the future of active motion gaming.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, your primary strength lies in visualizing intuitive, high-impact user interfaces. You will turn complex motion interactions into visually captivating, delightful, and pixel-perfect UI experiences that resonate across diverse age groups from young kids to parents.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will work at the intersection of game UI, visual storytelling, and interactive design, collaborating closely with game designers, and engineers to elevate the overall aesthetic standard of our products.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Define &amp;amp; Elevate Visual Identity:&lt;/strong&gt; Craft stunning, dynamic visual languages and UI systems for brand-new motion-based family games, ensuring each title has a distinct, delightful, and highly polished aesthetic.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;High-Craft UI Design &amp;amp; Asset Production:&lt;/strong&gt; Create production-ready UI components, visual assets and iconography that adapt seamlessly to various art styles.&lt;/li&gt;
