&lt;p&gt;Nex is located in&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;San Jose, California, USA&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Hong&amp;nbsp;Kong&lt;/strong&gt;. Learn more about us at&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nex.inc/who-we-are&quot; target=&quot;&quot;&gt;nex.inc/who-we-are&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We encourage applications even if you don’t meet more than 50% of the requirements — we believe that experience comes in many forms!&lt;/p&gt;
